  "Npcs.MinotaurKing.Desc": "Positioned between you and the Demon Queen is an opponent of singular size and stature - the Minotaur King. He is a beast beyond measure, covered in shaggy fur and a few scraps of leather that do nothing to hide the pillar of flared cuntplow between his legs. In his hands is a gigantic axe, though he seems loathe to use it, preferring to rely on the erotic scent emanating from between his legs. He smells virile, strong, and more alluring than you'd expect. You'd best be careful not to dwell on it."
